<Base title="Privacy" description="How this Nichols Auto Repair website preview handles contact details and links to other services."><article class="wrap article"><span class="eyebrow">NICHOLS AUTO REPAIR</span><h1>Your information<br/><em>deserves care.</em></h1><div class="article-body"><h2>About this preview</h2><p>This version of the website does not include analytics, advertising trackers, embedded maps, or a customer account system. Its contact form prepares an email on your device; the website does not save or send the form to a server.</p><h2>Contacting the shop</h2><p>If you send an email or call, the shop receives the information you choose to provide. Please avoid including payment details, identification documents, VINs, or other sensitive information in a website inquiry.</p><h2>Other services</h2><p>Links to Google Maps and other external services open websites governed by their own privacy policies. Email is handled by your email provider and the shop’s provider.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>This notice describes the current preview. It will need to be reviewed and updated if hosting, analytics, online booking, or other data-handling features are added.</p><p>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:nicholsauto2@gmail.com">nicholsauto2@gmail.com</a>.</p></div></article></Base>
